B.aqJ=new A.F(358,B.a00)
B.a3D=s(["The mic on an item works the simple way again: for notes under ~15 lines, tapping it changes NOTHING \u2014 same box, same text, and your dictation lands right at your cursor, freely mixed with typing."],t.s)
B.amv=new A.F(357,B.a3D)
B.a_0=s(["Edit mode fixed for real: every note\u2019s text is now fully visible and reachable while editing \u2014 the field follows your cursor and scrolls when needed. Longer notes go to the full window automatically."],t.s)
B.amH=new A.F(356,B.a_0)
B.a3v=s(["Tapping an item\u2019s mic no longer shrinks the box \u2014 the note\u2019s text stays fully visible while you dictate into it (large notes keep their preview height).","This \u201cWhat\u2019s new\u201d popup is easier to read \u2014 bigger text."],t.s)
B.an6=new A.F(355,B.a3v)
B.a_X=s(["Long notes no longer fight the list: a big item shows as a compact preview (title + first lines + \u201ctap to open\u201d), and its reading/editing lives in the full window. Short notes still edit right in place."],t.s)
B.amh=new A.F(354,B.a_X)
B.a2H=s(["Dictation now lands WHERE YOUR CURSOR IS when you\u2019re typing \u2014 and the live grey preview flows inline with your words instead of flashing on a line below.","The reader now speaks each item\u2019s TITLE before its text."],t.s)
B.aoP=new A.F(353,B.a2H)
B.a1X=s(["Listening is now ONE simple switch per item: the headphones tag decides if it plays \u2014 uncheck any item (even inside a playing folder) and it\u2019s out of the playlist; a folder\u2019s headphones just flips everything under it. Playback follows your folder order."],t.s)
B.amq=new A.F(352,B.a1X)
